# xKiro's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-xkiro-setting-api-key = An xKiro API key from your account at https://xkiro.com. It is sent only to api.xkiro.com; reading usage spends no tokens.

## The report: the daily free tokens and the wallet balance. Plan names
## stay as xKiro sends them.

usage-xkiro-free-tokens = Free tokens
usage-xkiro-tokens-used-today = Tokens used today
usage-xkiro-daily-allowance = Daily allowance
# The daily allowance of an account xKiro reports no cap for.
usage-xkiro-no-cap-reported = No cap reported
usage-xkiro-tokens-remaining = Tokens remaining
# When the free tokens reset; the value is a time of day, 00:00 UTC.
usage-xkiro-daily-reset = Daily reset
# The plan line of an account without a plan.
usage-xkiro-pay-as-you-go = Pay as you go
usage-xkiro-wallet = Wallet
